### Catalog module — manual requests for Etapa 1 (Postman/curl/IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Prerequisite: register + login a PRODUCER and an ARTIST via /api/auth/* (see users-API.md),
### then paste the tokens below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@producerToken = PASTE_PRODUCER_TOKEN_HERE
@artistToken = PASTE_ARTIST_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Publish a beat (PRODUCER) — expect 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats
Authorization: Bearer {{producerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Trap Beat",
  "genre": "Trap",
  "bpm": 140,
  "key": "Am",
  "audioUrl": "https://soundcloud.com/example/trap-beat"
}

### 1b. Publish a beat as ARTIST — expect 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Trap Beat",
  "genre": "Trap",
  "bpm": 140,
  "audioUrl": "https://soundcloud.com/example/trap-beat"
}

### 1c. Publish a beat unauthenticated — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Trap Beat",
  "genre": "Trap",
  "bpm": 140,
  "audioUrl": "https://soundcloud.com/example/trap-beat"
}

### 2. List all beats — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats

### 2b. List beats filtered by genre — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats?genre=Trap

### 2c. List beats filtered by genre + bpm — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats?genre=Trap&bpm=140

### 2d. List beats by producerId — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats?producerId=1

### 3. Get beat detail — expect 200 (adjust id after step 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/1

### 3b. Get beat detail, missing id — expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/99999

### 4. Comment on a beat (ARTIST or PRODUCER) — expect 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buenísimo el beat"
}

### 4b. Comment unauthenticated — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buenísimo el beat"
}

### 4c. Comment on a missing beat — expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/99999/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{artistToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Buenísimo el beat"
}

### 5. List comments on a beat — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beats/1/comments
